        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Mamet, William H. Macy, Debra Eisenstadt\n- Works: Oleanna, Oleanna (film)\n- Topics: film adaptation, acting careers\n\nFacts:\n- William Hall Macy Jr. was born on March 13, 1950, and he is an American actor, screenwriter, teacher, and theatre director.\n- In 1994, David Mamet wrote and directed the drama film \"Oleanna,\" which was based on his play \"Oleanna.\"\n- The 1994 film \"Oleanna\" starred William H. Macy and Debra Eisenstadt.\n- William H. Macy's film career has been built mostly on appearances in small independent films, although he has also appeared in summer action films.",
